                        "Database {DatabaseName} was built for TenantId {TenantId} but HRMS registration failed: {Reason}. " +
                        "Marked AwaitingRegistration - retry registration, do not re-provision.",
                        databaseName, tenantId, registration.FailureReason);
                }"""
